  "text": {
    "TXT_KEY_TECH_CARD_HOMUNCULUS_VATS": "Homunculus Vats",
    "TXT_KEY_TECH_CARD_HOMUNCULUS_VATS_HELP": "[ICON_BULLET]Can build the Homunculus Vats (national building, 1); the city with them can train Homunculi (national unit, 3).[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]A Homunculus is a frail caster. It is trained with a promotion to choose: one sphere I battle spell, which it knows without the sphere or its mana.",
    "TXT_KEY_TECH_CARD_HOMUNCULUS_VATS_PEDIA": "Grown in brine and glass, a little caster that knows one word of power.",
    "TXT_KEY_BUILDING_HOMUNCULUS_VATS": "Homunculus Vats",
    "TXT_KEY_BUILDING_HOMUNCULUS_VATS_PEDIA": "Glass tanks where homunculi are grown.",
    "TXT_KEY_UNIT_HOMUNCULUS": "Homunculus",
    "TXT_KEY_UNIT_HOMUNCULUS_PEDIA": "A frail caster grown in a vat, that knows one spell.",
